  _glyph: "\U0001F33C\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Sleep forever
  _description: Scarlet poppies whose scent puts anyone who breathes it to sleep.
    The [[5ff39499-2fcd-41a8-9b85-b171e6d0f529|Scarecrow]] and the [[d66a2c64-124c-4313-8911-f67c5e0e7b01|Tin
    Woodman]] do not breathe, so they carry [[397fd117-a8f8-4702-a3f6-36373425de00|Dorothy
    Gale]] out.
